        "@value": "\n\t\t\tRelates a claim or attestation to the RDF, RDFS, OWL object property, or OWL data property that represents the predicate of the claim.\n\t\t"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
